{"channelId":"UCqUDgEFG4NJi28G6EuHy-Aw","row":["Virginia Farm Animal Sanctuary",null,"Welcome to Virginia Farm Animal Sanctuary (VFAS)  — a place of lifelong sanctuary for farm animals in need of a forever home.\n\nMany of the animals here were once beloved pets whose families experienced life changes such as illness, loss, relocation, downsizing, or other circumstances beyond their control. When care needed a new place to continue, VFAS became that place.\n\nOur mission is simple: provide lifelong sanctuary, compassionate care, and peace of mind for both animals and the people who love them.\n\nFollow along for daily life at the sanctuary, animal stories, behind-the-scenes moments, educational content, tours, special events, and the frequent funny farm moment.\n\nHome to donkeys, goats, sheep, pigs, llamas, poultry, and more, every resident here has a story — and every story matters.","support@givebutter.com",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCqUDgEFG4NJi28G6EuHy-Aw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCqUDgEFG4NJi28G6EuHy-Aw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:08:52.986Z","channelId":"UCqUDgEFG4NJi28G6EuHy-Aw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"ba14753965ac0059c30a47364cdae7b76109f2b6deb3533ccc830795b9f18412","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"f91fe95d4c498f872bbf57da81d226e223759688badcd50d5e12a4197c345eca"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[],"emails":[{"address":"support@givebutter.com","purpose":"support","ownerRole":"unknown","identityStatus":"channel_published","sourceUrls":["https://givebutter.com/contact"],"evidenceIds":["public-page:8fc53a23216fab88ce8095ec"],"observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:45:09.600Z","deliveryVerified":false,"dnsStatus":"unknown","context":"页面原文: Live chatStart a chatEmailsupport@givebutter.comGivebutter Plus phone supportGivebutter Plus subscribers can access phone support from their dashboard 7 days a week, alongside 24/7 chat and email support.Go to dashboard ->\nHTML href: m